# game/script.rpy:45
translate zh_tw day1_368d6fa2:

    # "Not knowing exactly what you're doing, you drive down a highway with no destination in mind."
    "不太確定你身在何處，正在幹嘛，你正在高速公路上漫無目的地開車。"

# game/script.rpy:54
translate zh_tw day1_93b24227:

    # m "A penny for your thoughts?"
    m "給你一塊錢告訴我你在想甚麼？"

# game/script.rpy:55
translate zh_tw day1_6c9b63b4:

    # p "Just glad you're here with me."
    p "只是很高興你在這裡。"

# game/script.rpy:56
translate zh_tw day1_01db470b:

    # m "Me, too."
    m "我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:57
translate zh_tw day1_a48aa051:

    # "You smile at each other."
    "你們對著彼此微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:58
translate zh_tw day1_f6b8b50e:

    # "Even without words, there's no awkwardness at all."
    "你感覺不到尷尬的氣氛，儘管你們都沒說話。"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate zh_tw day1_614f87e5:

    # "You know this is the happiest you'll ever be."
    "你知道這是你一生最快樂的時候了。"

# game/script.rpy:64
translate zh_tw day1_89dc0363:

    # p "Fuck!"
    p "幹！"

# game/script.rpy:65
translate zh_tw day1_5c5fc5ca:

    # daycard "DAY 1"
    daycard "第一天"

# game/script.rpy:68
translate zh_tw day1_9993de5e:

    # "You wake up slowly and start to realize none of it was real."
    "你緩慢地起床，開始了解剛剛一切都不是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate zh_tw day1_ab6a54a7:

    # "What you would sacrifice just to get back to that dream..."
    "你願意犧牲一切只為回到剛剛那場夢裡。"

# game/script.rpy:70
translate zh_tw day1_9a90a85f:

    # "Reality strikes back: you're just a freshman starting college."
    "現實是，你只是位準備要上大學的新生。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate zh_tw day1_d4aa3508:

    # "You're studying:"
    "你就讀："

# game/script.rpy:82
translate zh_tw day1_4330cf17:

    # "Life hasn't treated you too badly, but you still have your lows."
    "你的人生沒有很糟，儘管有些低潮。"

# game/script.rpy:83
translate zh_tw day1_874c816f:

    # "You're already 18 years old, and you've never been in a relationship."
    "你已經18歲了而你依舊還是母胎單身。"

# game/script.rpy:84
translate zh_tw day1_2b0dd25c:

    # "You were never one of the cool kids in school, just a shy kid no one really remembers."
    "你從來就不是學校的酷孩子，只是個沒人記得的害羞小孩。"

# game/script.rpy:85
translate zh_tw day1_5ff2d43f:

    # "There are many reasons you turned out the way you are today:"
    "有很多事情造就了現在的你："

# game/script.rpy:86
translate zh_tw day1_81170efc:

    # "Maybe some family drama, friend issues, or even being bullied."
    "可能是一些家庭雜事，朋友問題，甚至是被霸凌。"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate zh_tw day1_3c1868ef:

    # "But none of that really matters anymore."
    "但那一切都對現在來說都不重要。"

# game/script.rpy:88
translate zh_tw day1_bdac83d1:

    # "You still had good friends around to support you, at least until now."
    "你依然還有支持你的朋友們，直到現在。"

# game/script.rpy:89
translate zh_tw day1_17cf1c1d:

    # "New college, new environment, new people."
    "新大學，新環境，也等於要認識新的人。"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate zh_tw day1_dcd6107a:

    # "You're excited and nervous at the same time."
    "你既興奮又緊張。"

# game/script.rpy:91
translate zh_tw day1_834e4e27:

    # "You don't want to screw up, but you also know you're destined to."
    "畢竟你不想搞砸一切，儘管你知道你註定會。"

# game/script.rpy:92
translate zh_tw day1_559fc325:

    # p "(sigh) Guess it's time."
    p "(嘆氣) 時候到了。"

# game/script.rpy:93
translate zh_tw day1_0d893967:

    # "You freshen up and get ready to head to school."
    "你整理好自己後準備出門。"

# game/script.rpy:94
translate zh_tw day1_f44eacdc:

    # "You put on your headphones and pick the music that represents you the most."
    "你戴上耳機，並選了最代表你的音樂播放。"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate zh_tw day1_024aeb02:

    # "You are ready."
    "你準備好了。"

# game/script.rpy:96
translate zh_tw day1_13596cb1:

    # "Perchance?"
    "或許？"

# game/script.rpy:101
translate zh_tw day1_2d5eeeee:

    # "Trying to choose the right song for the vibe, you don't notice someone walking up to you."
    "當你在挑選適合現在的歌時，你沒有注意到由人朝你靠近。"

# game/script.rpy:102
translate zh_tw day1_78e1f919:

    # q "Excuse me, can you give me a little help?"
    q "不好意思，能請你幫個忙嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate zh_tw day1_ac461b86:

    # "Hearing someone call out, you look up and see a girl waving at you."
    "你終於發現有人在叫你，你抬頭看到一個女生正朝你揮手。"

# game/script.rpy:106
translate zh_tw day1_a458cf01:

    # q "Do you know how to get to the bus station?"
    q "你知道怎麼去公車站嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate zh_tw day1_39fefdc7:

    # "Having lived here for so long, you know exactly where the bus station is."
    "你當然知道在哪，畢竟你住在這地方很久了。"

# game/script.rpy:108
translate zh_tw day1_86e5555e:

    # p "Yeah, just go straight, then turn left at the next block. You should see it."
    p "當然。一直往前走看到一個路口左轉後就會出現在妳眼前。"

# game/script.rpy:109
translate zh_tw day1_dc6c2c22:

    # q "Next block, turn left... Got it! Thank you so much!"
    q "看到路口左轉...知道了，謝拉！"

# game/script.rpy:110
translate zh_tw day1_bdca155f:

    # "She thanks you and heads straight for the bus station before you can say anything."
    "她向你道謝便逕直往巴士站走了，沒給你任何時間說任何話。"

# game/script.rpy:111
translate zh_tw day1_858de7e8:

    # p "No problem..."
    p "沒問題..."

# game/script.rpy:112
translate zh_tw day1_1f532436:

    # "Feeling stupid for even fantasizing that something more would happen, you walk faster toward campus, trying to shake off the embarrassment."
    "想到自己蠢到還能有甚麼後續，你快步往學校方向前進以甩開剛剛的尷尬。"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate zh_tw day1_b52470fb:

    # "Thanks to your fast walking, you arrive pretty early."
    "而因為你的快步，你很早就到學校了。"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate zh_tw day1_978f6afc:

    # "Which also means you can choose the seat you want in the classroom."
    "這也表示你可以選擇坐哪個位子。"

# game/script.rpy:118
translate zh_tw day1_ba9bd8e4:

    # "You've tried every possible variation."
    "你試過各種地方。"

# game/script.rpy:119
translate zh_tw day1_79446243:

    # "The back row is usually for the 'players,' the front row is for the 'nerds,' and the middle seats are... nothing special."
    "後排是給'玩咖'的，前排則是給'書蟲'的，至於中間排則沒什麼特別。"

# game/script.rpy:120
translate zh_tw day1_c0d6d12d:

    # "You're basically a master of seating at this point, and you know there's no point in overthinking it."
    "你基本上就是位子大師，因此你也了解選甚麼位子根本沒屁用。"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate zh_tw day1_9cb7810f:

    # "So you make your choice and take a seat."
    "所以你隨便選了個位子坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:122
translate zh_tw day1_7cfaceb8:

    # "Not knowing what else to do, you put on your headphones and start playing with your phone."
    "而不知道要幹嘛，你再次戴上你的耳機並開始玩你的手機。"

# game/script.rpy:125
translate zh_tw day1_33a46fdf:

    # "Some time later..."
    "一段時間過後..."

# game/script.rpy:128
translate zh_tw day1_e56c81b3:

    # "You notice that the class is about to start."
    "你注意到課程要開始了。"

# game/script.rpy:129
translate zh_tw day1_028174e6:

    # "Then you feel someone tap your shoulder from behind."
    "然後你感覺到有人在輕拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate zh_tw day1_80d6a376:

    # q "Hey, glad to meet you again!"
    q "嘿，又見面啦！"

# game/script.rpy:131
translate zh_tw day1_4e6e47d0:

    # "You look up and realize she's the girl who asked you for directions earlier."
    "你抬頭看去發現是那位稍早問你公車站在哪的女孩。"

# game/script.rpy:134
translate zh_tw day1_492b6b7a:

    # p "Hey! I didn't know you were in this class, too."
    p "嗨！我不知道你也有修這門課。"

# game/script.rpy:135
translate zh_tw day1_c284b74e:

    # q "Well, who would have known, right? HAHA."
    q "誰會猜得到呢，哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:136
translate zh_tw day1_f5e2468a:

    # q "I should give you a proper thanks though, I was in a hurry earlier."
    q "我應該跟你好好道謝，我早上的時候有點趕。"

# game/script.rpy:137
translate zh_tw day1_cb5a00db:

    # p "It's fine, I could tell. HAHA."
    p "沒關係，我感覺得出來，哈哈!"

# game/script.rpy:138
translate zh_tw day1_bb4c99c9:

    # a "I'm Elena, you?"
    a "我叫ELena，你呢？"

# game/script.rpy:139
translate zh_tw day1_cad991e2:

    # p "[player_name]."
    p "[player_name]."

# game/script.rpy:140
translate zh_tw day1_1073a3de:

    # "She sits down next to you as soon as you finish."
    "她在你說完這句話的同時坐到你旁邊。"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate zh_tw day1_6f35c6ea:

    # a "Well, [player_name], nice to meet you."
    a "那，[player_name]，很高興認識你！"

# game/script.rpy:145
translate zh_tw day1_673a4ff7:

    # "You listen to the lecture with your full attention, though sometimes you zone out."
    "你非常專注地聆聽課程，儘管有時你還是恍神了。"

# game/script.rpy:146
translate zh_tw day1_b1d4bea0:

    # t "Alright class, before the lecture ends, I want you to know that this lecture will have a group assignment."
    t "好了同學們，在下課之前，這堂課有分組作業。"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate zh_tw day1_50e2de27:

    # t "Since you're all freshmen, I will assign the group myself."
    t "而既然你們都是新生，就由我來分配組別。"

# game/script.rpy:148
translate zh_tw day1_bad6c284:

    # "You're glad you don't have to pretend to be an extrovert and find some teammates."
    "你很慶幸你不用假裝自己很外向地去找組員。"

# game/script.rpy:149
translate zh_tw day1_f09f681e:

    # t "I will divide the groups by seat. You'll be paired with the student sitting next to you."
    t "我就按照座位分組，你會跟坐在你旁邊的學生一組。"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate zh_tw day1_74fa148d:

    # t "You should know who your partner is now. Let me know if you have any questions."
    t "你們應該知道組員是誰了，有問題請跟我說。"

# game/script.rpy:151
translate zh_tw day1_628320b7:

    # "You realize you'll be in the same group as Elena."
    "你發現你會跟Elena同一組。"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate zh_tw day1_41ffca22:

    # a "What are the odds!"
    a "看看這巧合！"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate zh_tw day1_a6543c1a:

    # p "Yeah!"
    p "對阿！"

# game/script.rpy:157
translate zh_tw day1_88774b4f:

    # a "We should exchange contact info to discuss the assignment, yeah?"
    a "我們應該交換聯絡方式好討論作業，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:158
translate zh_tw day1_f7cfb03d:

    # p "Sure!"
    p "當然！"

# game/script.rpy:159
translate zh_tw day1_661d92d2:

    # "While you're typing in her contact, Elena keeps talking."
    "Elena在你打字的同時跟你說話。"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate zh_tw day1_c52afc97:

    # a "The universe really wants us together, huh?"
    a "這世界真的很想要我們在一起，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:161
translate zh_tw day1_c7e761bf:

    # "Overthinking that sentence way too much, you freeze for a second."
    "過度思索這句話的涵義，你安靜了幾秒。"

# game/script.rpy:162
translate zh_tw day1_88c5f680:

    # p "Yeah, I guess so. HAHA."
    p "我猜是吧，哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:163
translate zh_tw day1_a2e6adb6:

    # p "(Idiot, get your head together.)"
    p "(白癡，腦袋清醒點。)"

# game/script.rpy:164
translate zh_tw day1_3bb2218e:

    # "Sometimes I wish I was better."
    "有時我真希望我能更好。"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate zh_tw day1_b0550af3:

    # "You return home, thinking this day could have gone worse."
    "回到家，你思考著今天原本可能更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:174
translate zh_tw day1_74c41b4c:

    # "However, it actually went better than you expected."
    "出乎預料之外，今天其實還算不錯。"

# game/script.rpy:175
translate zh_tw day1_1e3dfcea:

    # "Replaying the day in your head, you lie on your bed and take a deep breath."
    "你躺在床上，吸氣吐氣，回想著今天發生的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:176
translate zh_tw day1_049a8769:

    # "You take out the phone and start looking at [player_name2]'s photos."
    "你拿出手機開始看 [player_name2] 的社群。"

# game/script.rpy:177
translate zh_tw day1_3969d9db:

    # "You might have had a chance to be with her, but none of it ever happened."
    "你也許曾經跟她有機會，但那一切並沒有發生。"

# game/script.rpy:178
translate zh_tw day1_82641644:

    # "Sometimes you think it's the unknown possibility of that future that makes you regret it and dwell on it so much."
    "有時你覺得正是因為那個未來有如此多可能，才會讓你一直回想著與她的可能。"

# game/script.rpy:179
translate zh_tw day1_3ddcda9a:

    # "You take a shower, chat with your old friends, and get ready for bed."
    "你決定去洗個澡，跟老朋友們敘舊完後便去睡覺了。"

# game/script.rpy:180
translate zh_tw day1_674caa97:

    # p "Sweet dreams, I hope."
    p "住我有個好夢，希望。"

# game/script.rpy:186
translate zh_tw day2_0cb4dfd0:

    # daycard "DAY 2"
    daycard "第二天"

# game/script.rpy:190
translate zh_tw day2_09b18a96:

    # "Another day, another class."
    "新的一天，新的課程。"

# game/script.rpy:191
translate zh_tw day2_d948c551:

    # "Somehow, you still arrive at class early today."
    "你不知為何地依舊還是早到了。"

# game/script.rpy:192
translate zh_tw day2_81ee2d47:

    # "This time, though, you see a girl who apparently came even earlier than you."
    "然而這次，你發現到有位女生比你還早到學校。"

# game/script.rpy:193
translate zh_tw day2_4c41e9fa:

    # "She's sitting in the front row."
    "她坐在教室前排。"

# game/script.rpy:194
translate zh_tw day2_6c3deaf3:

    # "At first glance, she seems like the shy type, and a good student who takes class seriously."
    "僅憑第一印象，她看起來像是個害羞的好學生。"

# game/script.rpy:195
translate zh_tw day2_114a1535:

    # "Maybe you should get closer to her and see what happens."
    "也許你應該嘗試認識她，看看如何。"

# game/script.rpy:196
translate zh_tw day2_496476f5:

    # "Which sounds like a weird idea, even in your head."
    "聽起來是個有點奇怪的想法。"

# game/script.rpy:197
translate zh_tw day2_bb37f968:

    # "Trying not to creep her out, you take the seat behind her."
    "你決定坐在她後面，不想嚇到她。"

# game/script.rpy:198
translate zh_tw day2_c6dba5c8:

    # "You try to start a conversation with her, but every time you're about to speak, something holds you back."
    "你嘗試想要跟她聊天，但每次你準備好時就有甚麼東西阻止了你。"

# game/script.rpy:199
translate zh_tw day2_c0fa676c:

    # "Eventually, you give up and start playing with your phone again."
    "最終你放棄了。你決定繼續玩你的手機。"

# game/script.rpy:200
translate zh_tw day2_33a46fdf:

    # "Some time later..."
    "一段時間後..."

# game/script.rpy:203
translate zh_tw day2_4a70673f:

    # "You listen to the lecture with your full attention, though you zone out now and then."
    "你非常專注地聆聽課程，儘管有時你還是恍神了"

# game/script.rpy:204
translate zh_tw day2_65360e6c:

    # t "Alright class, before we finish, I want you to know that this course will have a group project, due the week after next."
    t "好了同學們，在下課之前，這堂課有分組報告，並且下下周就截止。"

# game/script.rpy:205
translate zh_tw day2_dc5641a8:

    # t "So you should probably start to discuss your project early."
    t "所以我推薦你們盡早開始討論報告。"

# game/script.rpy:206
translate zh_tw day2_50e2de27:

    # t "Since you're all freshmen, I will assign the group myself."
    t "而既然你們都是新生，就由我來分配組別。"

# game/script.rpy:207
translate zh_tw day2_9e5acc6f:

    # "Once again, you're glad you don't have to find teammates yourself."
    "你再次慶幸你不用假裝自己很外向地去找組員。"

# game/script.rpy:208
translate zh_tw day2_38ffb304:

    # t "I will divide the groups by seat. Each group will have four members."
    t "我就按照座位分組，每組一方格4個人。"

# game/script.rpy:209
translate zh_tw day2_027a6529:

    # t "You should know which group you're in now, let me know if you have any questions."
    t "你們應該知道組員是誰了，有問題請跟我說。"

# game/script.rpy:210
translate zh_tw day2_a2581490:

    # "You realize you'll be in the same group as the girl sitting in front of you."
    "你發現你會跟前面的女生同一組。"

# game/script.rpy:213
translate zh_tw day2_78a2a441:

    # "Since you're all in the same group, you figure you should take the initiative and greet your teammates."
    "既然你們都在同一組，你覺得你應該主動跟組員打招呼。"

# game/script.rpy:214
translate zh_tw day2_2bc49fd9:

    # "You exchange your social accounts and learn each other's names."
    "你們交換了聯絡方式並知道了大家的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:217
translate zh_tw day2_dcb42777:

    # b "My name is Emma, nice to meet you."
    b "我叫Emma，很高興認識你。"

# game/script.rpy:218
translate zh_tw day2_c9d0c61e:

    # p "Nice to meet you too."
    p "我也很高興認識你。"

# game/script.rpy:219
translate zh_tw day2_4b5c562a:

    # p "I'm [player_name]."
    p "我叫 [player_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:220
translate zh_tw day2_aaa45f48:

    # "You also learn the other two's names, Chris and Gus, but that's probably not important right now, right?"
    "你也知道其他組員的名字，分別是Gus和Chris，但這不重要，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:226
translate zh_tw day2_e10a73e0:

    # "You get back home."
    "你回到家。"

# game/script.rpy:227
translate zh_tw day2_36d76a13:

    # "Today wasn't that bad."
    "今天還不算糟。"

# game/script.rpy:228
translate zh_tw day2_e2c30638:

    # "Time to freshen up and go to sleep."
    "是時候該洗洗睡了。"

# game/script.rpy:229
translate zh_tw day2_d2058859:

    # "But this time, you don't feel like doing that yet."
    "但是，你現在並不想做這些事。"

# game/script.rpy:230
