    # z "Well, maybe I should let you and Emma know each other better, since we're in the same group now?"
    z "哼...也許我應該讓你跟Emma更熟一點，畢竟我們現在同組。"

# game/script.rpy:436
translate zh_tw day4_1c3eb6b7:

