    "他朝你眨眼。"

# game/script.rpy:441
translate zh_tw day4_f4aefdb8:

    # z "I don't know her that well but we hang out with friends together sometimes."
    z "我跟她沒有到很熟但我們會跟朋友一起出去玩。"

