    p "真假？所以她是怎樣的人？"

# game/script.rpy:443
translate zh_tw day4_f4275ce7:

    # z "What, you're interested?"
    z "怎樣，你有興趣喔？"

# game/script.rpy:444
translate zh_tw day4_7c3b613d:

    # z "HAHA just kidding."
    z "哈哈，開玩笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:445
translate zh_tw day4_ab2d6051:

    # z "Don't be fooled by how she acts. She's actually pretty outgoing and fun around her friends."
    z "別被她平常樣子騙了，她跟她朋友一起玩的時候都很活潑。"

# game/script.rpy:446
translate zh_tw day4_f80eac96:

    # z "She's just shy around people she doesn't know much."
    z "她只是會對不認識的人感到害羞而已。"

# game/script.rpy:447
translate zh_tw day4_f129cac2:

    # z "Once you get to know her, you'll understand."
    z "你會懂的，等到你跟她變熟的時候。"

# game/script.rpy:448
translate zh_tw day4_15d4073b:

    # p "(Kind of sounds like me.)"
    p "(聽起來有點像我。)"

# game/script.rpy:449
translate zh_tw day4_5e244c53:

    # p "Yeah, I hope."
    p "嗯，希望如此。"

# game/script.rpy:450
translate zh_tw day4_c85f9e6f:

    # z "Don't worry man, I'll help break the ice."
    z "別擔心老兄，我會幫忙破冰的。"

# game/script.rpy:451
translate zh_tw day4_ca5e8c07:

    # "Gus's phone buzzes, and he picks it up."
    "你聽到Gus的手機在響，而Gus去接電話了。"

# game/script.rpy:452
translate zh_tw day4_8173d360:

    # z "...And speak of the devil!"
    z "說曹操，曹操到。"

# game/script.rpy:453
translate zh_tw day4_862d9f71:

