    z "Emma說她也沒問題。"

# game/script.rpy:460
translate zh_tw day4_0179a3ce:

    # z "I'll ask Chris later."
    z "我等下再來問Chris。"

# game/script.rpy:461
translate zh_tw day4_17c395cd:

    # p "Appreciate the help, man."
    p "謝啦，哥。"

# game/script.rpy:462
translate zh_tw day4_95507fbc:

    # z "No problem."
    z "Ok的。"

# game/script.rpy:469
translate zh_tw day4_785bad03:

    # "You have lunch with Zane."
    "你跟Zane一起吃午餐。"

# game/script.rpy:470
translate zh_tw day4_53e2f4eb:

    # "He's a student you met in another class."
    "你是在另外一堂課認識他的。"

# game/script.rpy:471
translate zh_tw day4_131067a4:

    # "Also, he might be the first friend you made in this school."
    "他也是你在這學校交到的第一個朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:472
translate zh_tw day4_39e63f82:

    # "You guys get along pretty well; you have common interests:"
    "你們相處得不錯，你們有共同興趣:"

# game/script.rpy:473
translate zh_tw day4_97fcec5f:

    # "You like to play video games and share the same taste in movies."
    "你們喜歡打電動，你們在電影方面有相同的品味。"

# game/script.rpy:474
translate zh_tw day4_baa4fcf5:

    # x "...so that's why I like Pixels."
    x "...所以這就是為甚麼我喜歡世界大對戰。"

# game/script.rpy:475
translate zh_tw day4_2882d6a0:

    # p "Yeah, that movie has its flaws, but I think it's definitely worth a watch."
    p "嗯，那電影絕對有缺點，但我覺得還是很可看的。"

# game/script.rpy:476
translate zh_tw day4_a3acec13:

    # x "So... how's your day?"
    x "所以...近來如何？"

# game/script.rpy:477
translate zh_tw day4_e3df1b21:

    # x "Feels like the class is already too hard for me. HAHA."
    x "我感覺課程對我來說已經太困難了哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:478
translate zh_tw day4_3182e811:

    # p "I guess it's okay for now. I have a group project, though."
    p "目前還可以吧，有分組作業就是了。"

# game/script.rpy:479
translate zh_tw day4_12e3a336:

    # x "How is it?"
    x "那如何？"

# game/script.rpy:480
translate zh_tw day4_7e441e7d:

    # p "Don't like group projects, but I think I'll do better this time."
    p "不喜歡分組作業。不過我覺得這次感覺會比較好。"

# game/script.rpy:481
translate zh_tw day4_c086e970:

    # x "Why?"
    x "怎麼說？"

# game/script.rpy:482
translate zh_tw day4_09cc78ba:

    # p "Just feel like the team is getting along."
    p "感覺我們組相處不錯。"

# game/script.rpy:483
translate zh_tw day4_8b7ce78b:

    # x "Who's in it?"
    x "誰在裡面？"

# game/script.rpy:484
translate zh_tw day4_ba704061:

    # p "Come on, even if I say the name you wouldn't know who they are."
    p "拜託老兄，就算我把名字說出來了你也不知道是誰。"

# game/script.rpy:485
translate zh_tw day4_0f51509a:

    # x "Try me."
    x "先說再說。"

# game/script.rpy:486
translate zh_tw day4_72e54173:

    # p "Fine. There's Emma, Gus, and Chris."
    p "好啦。有Emma，Gus，Chris。"

# game/script.rpy:487
translate zh_tw day4_7806fd45:

    # p "Just happen to be in the same group by accident."
    p "這是隨便被分配到的組別。"

# game/script.rpy:488
translate zh_tw day4_ddc7ec47:

    # x "So, tell me about Emma, is she single or not? Your type? Or are you?..."
    x "所以...告訴我Emma，她單身嗎？你的菜？還是你？"

# game/script.rpy:489
translate zh_tw day4_1220726c:

    # p "Hold it, Jesus! I can't answer all of them at the same time."
    p "慢點，天啊！我沒辦法一次回答這麼多問題。"

# game/script.rpy:490
translate zh_tw day4_7c0bf69d:

    # p "Not sure, maybe, and you didn't even finish that sentence before I stopped you."
    p "首先不確定，也許？然後我打斷了你的下一個問題。"

# game/script.rpy:491
translate zh_tw day4_78822c6c:

    # "Zane rolls his eyes."
    "Zane翻了個白眼。"

# game/script.rpy:492
translate zh_tw day4_11e3224a:

    # p "But yeah, I think we're getting along."
    p "但對，我覺得我們相處還不錯。"

# game/script.rpy:493
translate zh_tw day4_854ee282:

    # x "You lucky bastard. In school for a few days and you already know a girl."
    x "你真幸運，才在學校沒幾天就認識一個女的。"

# game/script.rpy:494
translate zh_tw day4_325d0e35:

    # "You're about to correct him."
    "你正打算糾正他。"

# game/script.rpy:495
translate zh_tw day4_8dc0fe84:

    # "But then you think there's nothing to brag about yet, so you stop."
    "但你覺得好像也沒什麼可以炫耀的，所以你停住了。"

