translate zh_tw day4_25b6e35d:

    # "Also, nothing is certain yet."
    "而且，一切都尚未成定局。"

# game/script.rpy:497
translate zh_tw day4_42988ef5:

    # "But Zane already noticed."
    "然而，Zane注意到你的行為了。"

# game/script.rpy:498
translate zh_tw day4_69b8284d:

    # x "Wait a minute, you're trying to say something."
    x "揪都媽爹，你剛剛好像想說甚麼。"

# game/script.rpy:499
translate zh_tw day4_2268c2fa:

    # x "Wait, can it be you already knew not one, but TWO girls? RIGHT?"
    x "等下，不會是你不只認識一個女生吧，兩個？"

# game/script.rpy:500
translate zh_tw day4_01a999d6:

    # p "Maybe. I'm still not sure."
    p "也許吧，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:501
translate zh_tw day4_aace4ae2:

    # x "Holy shit dude, how in the hell have you never had a girlfriend? This is ridiculous."
    x "我他媽老兄，你怎麼會是母單？這也太扯了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:502
translate zh_tw day4_3a37da93:

    # p "Relax, nothing has happened yet, and I suspect nothing will."
    p "不要激動，根本就也沒發生甚麼事，我也不覺得會有甚麼事發生。"

# game/script.rpy:503
translate zh_tw day4_ae7bc60c:

    # x "Dude, you got to give yourself some confidence, man."
    x "你需要給你自己一點信心，兄弟。"

# game/script.rpy:504
translate zh_tw day4_0efddbd5:

    # x "I bet that's why you've been single your whole life. You never take the initiative or have the guts, huh?"
    x "我猜這就是你母單的原因，你從不主動，沒有那勇氣對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:505
translate zh_tw day4_27997131:

    # p "Bro, what the fuck is that supposed to mean? And get out of my head!"
    p "老兄，三小啦？可以不要這麼懂我嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:506
translate zh_tw day4_2c5ba4f2:

    # x "HAHA, you're like an open book. Way too easy to read."
    x "哈哈！你這人太好猜了。"

# game/script.rpy:507
translate zh_tw day4_cbfda4f6:

    # x "But seriously, have some faith."
    x "但認真，給你自己一點信心。"

# game/script.rpy:508
translate zh_tw day4_689a3c1a:

    # x "Don't think too much about it."
    x "別想太多。"

# game/script.rpy:509
translate zh_tw day4_d43f4c50:

    # x "Just play it cool, and I'm sure you've got this, whatever this is."
    x "就自然讓它發生，你一定沒問題。"

# game/script.rpy:510
translate zh_tw day4_1e687502:

    # p "Trying my best out there."
    p "努力嘗試中。"

# game/script.rpy:516
translate zh_tw day5_1c8341e7:

    # daycard "DAY 5"
    daycard "第五天"

# game/script.rpy:519
translate zh_tw day5_6c388b08:

    # "Nothing interesting happens. You finish your classes."
    "沒什麼有趣的事，你乖乖上完了課。"

# game/script.rpy:520
translate zh_tw day5_60d57955:

    # "Then you remember it's time to work on the project with your group again."
    "然後你想到又要到要跟組別做報告的時候了。"

# game/script.rpy:521
translate zh_tw day5_2c3b94eb:

    # "So you grab a quick meal at a restaurant."
    "所以你快速前往餐廳吃完午餐。"

# game/script.rpy:522
translate zh_tw day5_9ba7fc49:

    # "Then you head to the place where the group agreed to meet."
    "便前往你們昨天約好的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:527
translate zh_tw day5_05e6bd2a:

    # "Everything is basically the same."
    "一切幾乎都上次一樣。"

# game/script.rpy:528
translate zh_tw day5_06947043:

    # "Emma is still polite and still takes the project seriously."
    "Emma還是很有禮貌，對報告很認真。"

# game/script.rpy:530
translate zh_tw day5_617e62cf:

    # "And this time, you've learned not to try talking to her while she's working."
    "而這次，你學乖了。你沒有在做報告時嘗試跟Emma聊天。"

# game/script.rpy:532
translate zh_tw day5_cb21d1d0:

    # "And you're still working hard on the project, too, taking it seriously."
    "而這次你也依舊努力專注在報告上。"

# game/script.rpy:533
translate zh_tw day5_7075ce25:

    # "But she seems brighter in your eyes this time."
    "但她這次看起來更開朗了。"

# game/script.rpy:534
translate zh_tw day5_440c1de6:

    # "During breaks, you laugh with her at Gus's stupid jokes."
    "你們在休息時間聽Gus的白痴笑話跟著一起笑。"

# game/script.rpy:535
translate zh_tw day5_4b477d10:

    # "They're still just ordinary interactions, but you can feel her walls getting thinner."
    "依舊還是稀鬆平常的互動，但你感覺到Emma的心房有逐漸放下。"

# game/script.rpy:538
translate zh_tw day5_33a46fdf:

    # "Some time later..."
    "一段時間後..."

# game/script.rpy:542
translate zh_tw day5_d9451e6f:

    # z "I think we're done!"
    z "我覺得我們搞定了！"

# game/script.rpy:543
translate zh_tw day5_84483762:

    # z "That took a while."
    z "真是花了不少時間。"

# game/script.rpy:544
translate zh_tw day5_e45172f7:

    # y "Alright guys, good job!"
    y "好了各位，做得好！"

# game/script.rpy:545
translate zh_tw day5_6b78fed7:

    # y "But I gotta go now."
    y "但我得要走了。"

# game/script.rpy:546
translate zh_tw day5_c4d9fad3:

    # z "What! Again?"
    z "三小，又來？"

# game/script.rpy:547
translate zh_tw day5_992a4968:

    # z "I thought we were gonna celebrate!"
    z "我以為我們要來慶祝ㄟ！"

# game/script.rpy:548
translate zh_tw day5_cc43500d:

    # y "It's fine, you guys go ahead. I'll be on my way now. Bye!"
    y "我沒差，你們去吧，我要先走了，掰！"

# game/script.rpy:549
translate zh_tw day5_330dc204:

    # "You figure Chris either has a girlfriend or is a serious introvert."
    "你覺得Chris要嘛是有女朋友了，要嘛他就是個很內向的人。"

# game/script.rpy:550
translate zh_tw day5_9a52359c:

    # p "Bye!"
    p "掰掰！"

# game/script.rpy:551
translate zh_tw day5_f484db20:

    # z "Bye!"
    z "掰！"

# game/script.rpy:552
translate zh_tw day5_3a5761f8:

    # b "Bye!"
    b "掰掰！"

# game/script.rpy:553
translate zh_tw day5_faa10e03:

    # "You're not sure if you're walking home together this time."
    "你不確定這次是不是又要一起走回家。"

# game/script.rpy:554
translate zh_tw day5_3ca5a501:

    # "So you move slowly trying to see what will happen."
    "所以你放慢動作看等等會發生甚麼事。"

# game/script.rpy:555
translate zh_tw day5_d6c889ea:

    # "Then Gus comes over again."
    "果然Gus又走過來了。"

# game/script.rpy:556
translate zh_tw day5_c66ae6f4:

    # z "Hey man, though Chris is gone, we still think we should celebrate, you will join us, right?"
    z "嘿老兄，我們還是想慶祝一下，儘管Chris走了。你會加入我們，對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:557
translate zh_tw day5_5a1c773e:

    # "Caught off guard by the sudden invitation, of course, you hesitate."
    "被這突如其來的邀約嚇到，你當然遲疑了。"

# game/script.rpy:558
translate zh_tw day5_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "嗯..."

# game/script.rpy:559
translate zh_tw day5_fa0e5522:

    # z "Come on man! It will be fun, I promise!"
    z "拜託喔老兄，會很好玩的啦，我保證！"

# game/script.rpy:560
translate zh_tw day5_85752e55:

    # z "And don't worry man, I already asked Emma and she said she's cool with it, too."
    z "喔而且不用擔心，我問過Emma了，她也沒問題。"

# game/script.rpy:561
translate zh_tw day5_344e4b0f:

    # z "There's nothing to worry about."
    z "根本不需要擔心啦！"

# game/script.rpy:562
translate zh_tw day5_4cb58b90:

    # "Clock is ticking, so is your mind."
    "時間正在繼續，你的思考也是。"

# game/script.rpy:563
translate zh_tw day5_f155e9e7:

    # "It feels like it takes forever as you calculate every possibility, and finally,"
    "你花了不知道多久算過多各種可能發生的事情，而最後，"

# game/script.rpy:564
translate zh_tw day5_fad7c077:

    # p "Fine, you convinced me."
    p "好啦，你說服我了。"

# game/script.rpy:565
translate zh_tw day5_9ca2459c:

    # p "Where are we going?"
    p "所以我們要去哪？"

# game/script.rpy:571
translate zh_tw day5_8003d830:

    # "Surprised, but also not surprised at all, you find yourself in an arcade."
    "有點驚訝但卻又不意外，你們在電子娛樂場裡。"

# game/script.rpy:572
translate zh_tw day5_a373ecdb:

    # "You used to go to places like this a lot."
    "你以前很常來這種地方。"

# game/script.rpy:573
translate zh_tw day5_e3c650b7:

    # "But for no real reason, you just stopped."
    "但不知為何你突然就不來了。"

# game/script.rpy:574
translate zh_tw day5_b5815c80:

    # p "Nice place!"
    p "不錯的地方！"

# game/script.rpy:578
translate zh_tw day5_6c17f949:

    # z "I know, right?"
    z "對吧？"

# game/script.rpy:579
translate zh_tw day5_6dae7f65:

    # z "Enough talking, let's play!"
    z "好了，廢話少說，開玩吧！"

# game/script.rpy:580
translate zh_tw day5_81a175d2:

    # "The three of you start playing all kinds of games."
    "你們三個玩了各式各樣的遊戲。"

# game/script.rpy:581
translate zh_tw day5_89e3d710:

